<title>POLAND: BFK Q1 net rises to PLN 10.0 mln.</title>
<headline>BFK Q1 net rises to PLN 10.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFK preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			18.47 vs	9.22</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  17.10 vs	7.21</p>
<p>    net profit				10.00 vs	4.08</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 85.61 vs     72.83</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  54.69 vs     53.38</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 7.14 vs	3.13</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.23 vs	0.10</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.60 vs	2.12</p>
<p>    investment				20.50 vs	3.56</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
